{"nodes": [{"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_preface", "label": "Preface \u2014 the shape of the argument", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_the_claim", "label": "The claim \u2014 a closed index contains its own definition and settles what may be added", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not three lucky properties but consequences of a single structural condition, each failing in a specific measurable way when it does not hold."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_six_things_and_no_more", "label": "Being a fixed point gives six things and no more", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_three_further_powers", "label": "Three further powers, none of which follows from closure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Order recovery only across a tree, a wrong value only from outside the index, a wrong derivation only along a second independent route."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_reference_limit", "label": "Closure never gives that the coordinates refer to anything in the world", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Which is why Chapter 16 carries six defences rather than three, and why one of the six cannot be run by this book at all."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_openness_is_measurement", "label": "Openness is a measurement; closure is where it comes out zero", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Where a relabelling into a closed index exists, E measures the drawing; where none exists, E measures the world. The two readings are one operator read in two directions, which is why neither could be sharpened from inside the other."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_object_lambda", "label": "The object \u2014 \u039b, a recoding of atomic electron configurations on eight coordinates", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A recoding adds nothing, so whatever \u039b then displays is a property of indexing, not of atoms."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_bracket_demonstration", "label": "The demonstration \u2014 1,442 interior cells across 35 atomic systems", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_register_withdrawals", "label": "The register \u2014 1,629 withdrawn claims, each with what replaced it", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "That episode is the book's best evidence, and it is the account of an error."}, {"